{"product_id":"cues-master-custom-cue-butterfly-design","title":"Cues Master Custom Cue – Butterfly Design","description":"\u003cp class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"\u003eElevate your game with this handcrafted \u003cstrong\u003eCues Master Custom Cue\u003c\/strong\u003e, featuring a striking \u003cstrong\u003ebutterfly design\u003c\/strong\u003e that showcases expert craftsmanship and timeless elegance. The combination of figured maple and vibrant resin creates a cue that stands out both in appearance and performance.\u003cspan class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 19 oz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Length:\u003c\/strong\u003e 29.5 inches\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePin:\u003c\/strong\u003e Radial Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eForearm:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with resin butterfly points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandle:\u003c\/strong\u003e Premium resin handle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eButt Sleeve:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maple with matching resin butterfly points\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDesign:\u003c\/strong\u003e Butterfly-style construction with precision craftsmanship\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt for players who appreciate both beauty and playability, this cue offers a solid, consistent hit thanks to its radial pin construction, while the butterfly design highlights the artistry behind every handcrafted piece. Whether you're competing or adding to your collection, this cue delivers exceptional style and dependable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Cues Master Shop","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43448306008112,"sku":null,"price":18000.0,"currency_code":"PHP","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopif